{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_009_02_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f435f79d45fb121d4f2b3c59b7f3b6a63d411b729de489ed768ad74b2ff7cbe1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17b7c80d7ebb498c8b87e9822b49d4207bb214793d3bc97ed038df2a0313ed10",
      "text": "之前拜托的包下休息室的事，\n已经得到社长的许可了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8980959d3b844c4e22e4c087559f46411b50cf592fea2153d760345163e61f8",
      "text": "真的吗？太好啦——！\n制作人，谢谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c230e716912cccb42d045f1a30c145078bcc7c1d67f7818070efc829d178db1f",
      "text": "真不愧是制作人，办事效率真高。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:579001e9beeb22749e999bd4cc66ea4103174c6acc38128adf54d517e7d39c63",
      "text": "要是还有什么需要，请随时告诉我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e7528b25d1135bcd1a575e4e68eeb582834222d4b05625e393872549c438727",
      "text": "谢谢。呵呵，感觉会是一场很棒的派对呢。\n我们这边的准备也在顺利推进中哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5de39dc62bbdd244fed9650dfb02cb2c478943b902698dafa99af9333f30a4ca",
      "text": "嗯！我在做装饰。\n做很多很多，让恭二开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b94880260bff165ef7465be88591ed0db34bc8168e3a25e26012154a07ecd339",
      "text": "我在用生日花做花束。\n设计大概是这种感觉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbb12fac940fcd461f29863217a0f0622bb24d1f8cd7ab316e1136048762c119",
      "text": "两位在工作之余居然准备了这么多……\n一定会成为一场美妙的派对呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_b:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce9595605868ad24cc80c6b222ab46679cd4d1b38214cd746faee89b5b941ec9",
      "text": "谢谢！我和实，都最喜欢恭二了。\n所以，能超努力加油♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_b:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a19d121950491014ea0c45c26f211dc30761ea6235ece8c499e335c41414db43",
      "text": "是啊。当天恭二会露出怎样的表情呢……\n光是想象一下就干劲十足了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
